  "description": "Statement of Work template executed under a Mimir Labs Master Services Agreement. Supports Ratatosk governance engagements, Ragnarok migration engagements, integration projects, and advisory services. Source-of-truth markdown: docs/legal/STATEMENT_OF_WORK_TEMPLATE.md.",
