  "pageCount": 1,
  "body": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center;\">MIMIR LABS — STATEMENT OF WORK</h1><p><b>SOW No.:</b> <span style=\"background-color:#FFF3CD;border:1px solid #E8841A;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 4px;color:#E8841A;font-weight:bold;\">[SOW Number]</span></p><p><b>Effective Date:</b> <span style=\"background-color:#FFF3CD;border:1px solid #E8841A;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 4px;color:#E8841A;font-weight:bold;\">[Effective Date]</span></p><p><b>Issued under:</b> Mimir Labs Master Services Agreement <span style=\"background-color:#FFF3CD;border:1px solid #E8841A;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 4px;color:#E8841A;font-weight:bold;\">[MSA Number]</span> dated <span style=\"background-color:#FFF3CD;border:1px solid #E8841A;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 4px;color:#E8841A;font-weight:bold;\">[MSA Date]</span></p><p><b>Provider:</b> Mimir Labs LLC · <b>Client:</b> <span style=\"background-color:#FFF3CD;border:1px solid #E8841A;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 4px;color:#E8841A;font-weight:bold;\">[Client Entity]</span></p><h2>1. Engagement Type</h2><p><span style=\"background-color:#FFF3CD;border:1px solid #E8841A;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 4px;color:#E8841A;font-weight:bold;\">[Engagement Type]</span> (Ratatosk governance / Ragnarok migration / integration / advisory / other)</p><h2>2. Scope of Services</h2><p><span style=\"background-color:#FFF3CD;border:1px solid #E8841A;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 4px;color:#E8841A;font-weight:bold;\">[Scope]</span></p><h2>3. Deliverables</h2><table style=\"width:100%; border-collapse:collapse;\"><tr><th style=\"border:1px solid #ccc; padding:6px; text-align:left;\">#</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #ccc; padding:6px; text-align:left;\">Deliverable</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #ccc; padding:6px; text-align:left;\">Acceptance Criteria</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #ccc; padding:6px; text-align:left;\">Target Date</th></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc; padding:6px;\">1</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc; padding:6px;\"><span style=\"background-color:#FFF3CD;border:1px solid #E8841A;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 4px;color:#E8841A;font-weight:bold;\">[Deliverable 1]</span></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc; padding:6px;\"><span style=\"background-color:#FFF3CD;border:1px solid #E8841A;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 4px;color:#E8841A;font-weight:bold;\">[Criteria 1]</span></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc; padding:6px;\"><span style=\"background-color:#FFF3CD;border:1px solid #E8841A;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 4px;color:#E8841A;font-weight:bold;\">[Date 1]</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc; padding:6px;\">2</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc; padding:6px;\"><span style=\"background-color:#FFF3CD;border:1px solid #E8841A;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 4px;color:#E8841A;font-weight:bold;\">[Deliverable 2]</span></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc; padding:6px;\"><span style=\"background-color:#FFF3CD;border:1px solid #E8841A;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 4px;color:#E8841A;font-weight:bold;\">[Criteria 2]</span></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc; padding:6px;\"><span style=\"background-color:#FFF3CD;border:1px solid #E8841A;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 4px;color:#E8841A;font-weight:bold;\">[Date 2]</span></td></tr></table><h2>4. Timeline</h2><p>Estimated start: <span style=\"background-color:#FFF3CD;border:1px solid #E8841A;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 4px;color:#E8841A;font-weight:bold;\">[Start Date]</span> · Estimated completion: <span style=\"background-color:#FFF3CD;border:1px solid #E8841A;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 4px;color:#E8841A;font-weight:bold;\">[Completion Date]</span></p><h2>5. Fees</h2><p>Fee structure: <span style=\"background-color:#FFF3CD;border:1px solid #E8841A;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 4px;color:#E8841A;font-weight:bold;\">[Fixed-price / T&M / Milestone-based]</span></p><p>Total fees: $<span style=\"background-color:#FFF3CD;border:1px solid #E8841A;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 4px;color:#E8841A;font-weight:bold;\">[Total Fees]</span></p><p>Payment schedule: <span style=\"background-color:#FFF3CD;border:1px solid #E8841A;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 4px;color:#E8841A;font-weight:bold;\">[Schedule]</span></p><h3>5.1 Yggdrasil Activation Credit (if applicable)</h3><p>If this SOW covers Ratatosk and/or Ragnarok services and Client subsequently executes a Yggdrasil ERP Subscription Agreement, all fees actually paid under this SOW shall be credited 1:1 against the Yggdrasil Activation fee, in accordance with the Yggdrasil Subscription Agreement.</p><h2>6. Travel and Expenses</h2><p>On-site travel: <span style=\"background-color:#FFF3CD;border:1px solid #E8841A;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 4px;color:#E8841A;font-weight:bold;\">[Included / Billed at cost]</span>. Pre-approval required for travel-related expenses exceeding $500.</p><h2>7. Client Responsibilities</h2><p><span style=\"background-color:#FFF3CD;border:1px solid #E8841A;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 4px;color:#E8841A;font-weight:bold;\">[Client Responsibilities]</span></p><h2>8. Acceptance</h2><p>Each Deliverable shall be deemed accepted upon Client's written acceptance or upon expiration of ten (10) business days following delivery without written objection.</p><h2>9. Incorporated Terms</h2><p>This SOW is governed by the Mimir Labs Master Services Agreement referenced above. In the event of conflict between this SOW and the MSA, the MSA controls except where this SOW expressly modifies a specific MSA provision.</p><h2>Signatures</h2><table style=\"width:100%\"><tr><td style=\"width:50%; vertical-align:top;\"><p><b>PROVIDER — Mimir Labs LLC</b></p><p>Signature: ____________________________</p><p>Name: ____________________________</p><p>Title: ____________________________</p><p>Date: ____________________________</p></td><td style=\"width:50%; vertical-align:top;\"><p><b>CLIENT</b></p><p>Signature: ____________________________</p><p>Name: ____________________________</p><p>Title: ____________________________</p><p>Date: ____________________________</p></td></tr></table>",
